# Local dev: not needed — `npm run dev` / `npm run db:push` / `npm run db:seed`
# start a local PGlite-backed Postgres socket server and inject DATABASE_URL
# automatically (see package.json).
#
# Production: point this at a managed Postgres instance (Vercel Postgres or
# Supabase Free Tier, per docs/business-sim-game-design.md section 6/7).
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:password@host:5432/dbname"
